.ret, b.ret));\n        }\n        if a.err != b.err {\n            why.push(format!(\"cp_error_reason: {:?} vs {:?}\", a.err, b.err));\n        }\n        if let Some(d) = bytes_diff(\"out\", &a.out, &b.out) {\n            why.push(d);\n        }\n        Err(format!(\n            \"cp_inflate(in_bytes={in_bytes} out_bytes={out_bytes} ia={in_misalign} oa={out_misalign} in={})\\\\n  {}\",\n            hexdump(input),\n            why.join(\"\\\\n  \")\n        ))\n    }''')\n\ns = s.replace('''        Err(diff_msg(\n            &format!(\"load_png_mem(len={len}, png={})\", hexdump(png)),\n            &format!(\"{a:?}\"),\n            &format!(\"{b:?}\"),\n        ))\n    }''','''        let mut why = Vec::new();\n        if (a.w, a.h, a.null) != (b.w, b.h, b.null) {\n            why.push(format!(\n                \"img: w/h/null {:?} vs {:?}\",\n                (a.w, a.h, a.null),\n                (b.w, b.h, b.null)\n            ));\n        }\n        if a.err != b.err {\n            why.push(format!(\"cp_error_reason: {:?} vs {:?}\", a.err, b.err));\n        }\n        if let Some(d) = bytes_diff(\"pix\", &a.pix, &b.pix) {\n            why.push(d);\n        }\n        Err(format!(\n            \"load_png_mem(len={len}, png={})\\\\n  {}\",\n            hexdump(png),\n            why.join(\"\\\\n  \")\n        ))\n    }''')\np.write_text(s)\nprint(\"ok\")\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"tests/common/mod.rs\")\ns = p.read_text()\ns = s.replace(\"    const MSG_CAP: usize = 512;\", \"    const MSG_CAP: usize = 1024;\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ntimeout 300 cargo build --release --tests 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A5 | head -20; BIN=$(ls target/release/deps/valid_inflate-* | grep -v '\\.d$' | head -1); timeout 300 $BIN --exact c24_empty_distance_tree_reads_lit_287 --nocapture 2>&1 | head -30","description":"Improve diff reporting and re-inspect","timeout":400000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2